.el .ds Aq '
.TH FATHOM_SHOW 1  "fathom 0.1.0-alpha.1" 
.SH NAME
fathom\-show \- Show one episode in full
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfathom show\fR [\fB\-\-root\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIEPISODE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show one episode in full
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<ROOT>\fR [default: .]
The repository to read
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the episode as JSON on stdout, and nothing else there
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIEPISODE\fR>
The episode to show: a commit, a rev (`HEAD~3`, `main`, `v1.2^{}`) or an oid prefix
